  "prefLabel": "Env-A 804.15 Mass Balance Alternative to Compliance Stack Testing for VOC",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 804.15 Mass Balance Alternative to Compliance Stack Testing for VOC. For a stationary source using a control device designed to collect and recover VOC, such as a carbon adsorber, the mass balance alternative test as specified in Env-A 805.06 for the combined capture efficiency and control efficiency may be performed in place of compliance stack testing specified in Env-A 804.12.\n\nSource. #7788, eff 10-31-02; ss by #9802, eff 10-31-10; ss by #12762, eff 5-1-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a800.html"
